<h1>Brenda D. Waters</h1>
<p>4th Police District Council, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Filed nominating petitions on Oct. 19, 2026 for reelection. Her council biography says she is committed to bringing more transparency to the 4th District and wants residents and the Chicago Police Department to work together to make the community safer.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>4th District Council member since 2023 and its community engagement coordinator; born and raised in Chicago.</p>
